 "section_summary": "This section concludes Part 6 of a Civil Information and Education Section report on Fukui Prefecture, listing village, town, private, and ministry-controlled schools with founding dates, enrollment, and teaching staff, followed by a map of central Honshu. A Foreign Service despatch dated May 22, 1948 transmits Parts 8 and 37 of the same series, covering Fukushima and Shizuoka prefectures. The section then begins Part 8 on Fukushima Prefecture, including its contents, methodological introduction, institutional classification, prefectural summary, and statistical tables by level and jurisdiction.",
