   "about": "Continuation and conclusion of the institutional roster for Fukui Prefecture, giving school locations, founding dates, enrollment, and teacher counts for April and November 1946.",
   "summary": "The surviving portion begins midway through the roster of village and town youth schools and then catalogs boys’, girls’, and coeducational elementary schools, kindergartens, private secondary and special schools, and institutions controlled by ministries other than the Ministry of Education. Tables record founding dates, sex-disaggregated enrollment, and full- and part-time teaching staffs as of April 30 and November 30, 1946. The Fukui report concludes with prefectural grand totals and a map of central Honshu.",
