   "to": "",
   "about": "Introduces and begins the Fukushima Prefecture report, explaining its methodology and presenting summary statistics by educational level, school type, sex, and governing jurisdiction.",
   "summary": "The report describes a project intended to remedy serious deficiencies in Japanese educational recordkeeping by assembling a comprehensive roster of institutions, founding dates, enrollment, and teaching staffs. Its introduction explains the April and November 1946 comparison dates, pre-reform school classifications, national, public, and private control jurisdictions, data collection through the Ministry of Education, and limitations in the underlying statistics. The following tables summarize Fukushima institutions and compare enrollment, teachers, and school numbers by level, type, sex, and jurisdiction, then begin detailed jurisdictional tables for ministry, prefectural, municipal, village or town, and private schools.",
